---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  current="/team"
  title="Team — BTTMLINE"
  description="Geen anoniem bureau. De senior engineers die je strategie bepalen én de oplossing bouwen. Maak kennis met Ben Jorissen en Tom Kellens."
>

  <section class="sec sec-hero" style="max-width:1280px; margin:0 auto; padding:110px 32px 70px">
    <div style="font-family:'Geist',sans-serif; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--accent); margin-bottom:24px">Team</div>
    <h1 style="font-family:Geist; font-weight:600; font-size:clamp(34px,4.4vw,64px); line-height:1.03; letter-spacing:-.04em; margin:0; max-width:24ch">Geen anoniem bureau. De engineers die het ook echt bouwen.</h1>
    <p style="font-size:18px; line-height:1.65; color:rgba(var(--fg),.66); margin:36px 0 0; max-width:62ch; text-wrap:pretty">Bij BTTMLINE praat je niet met een accountmanager en krijg je daarna iemand anders. Je werkt met de mensen die de strategie bepalen én de oplossing bouwen. Senior software engineers die al ver voor de hype grote, complexe projecten neerzetten.</p>
  </section>

  <section style="border-top:1px solid rgba(var(--ov),.07)">
    <div class="sec" style="max-width:1280px; margin:0 auto; padding:80px 32px; display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(320px,1fr)); gap:20px">
      <div style="border:1px solid rgba(var(--ov),.1); background:var(--panel)">
        <div style="position:relative; height:360px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(var(--ov),.1); background:radial-gradient(120% 120% at 50% 0%, rgba(0,120,97,.18), rgba(8,11,10,0) 60%), repeating-linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(var(--ov),.035) 0 8px, transparent 8px 16px); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center">
          <span aria-hidden="true" style="font-family:Geist; font-weight:600; font-size:104px; letter-spacing:-.04em; color:rgba(var(--fg),.14)">BJ</span>
          <span style="position:absolute; left:20px; bottom:16px; font-family:'Geist',sans-serif; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:.06em; color:rgba(var(--fg),.4)">Foto volgt</span>
        </div>
        <div style="padding:34px 30px">
          <div style="font-family:Geist; font-weight:600; font-size:28px; letter-spacing:-.025em">Ben Jorissen</div>
          <div style="font-family:'Geist',sans-serif; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:.14em; color:var(--accent); margin-top:8px">MEDEOPRICHTER</div>
          <p style="font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; color:rgba(var(--fg),.66); margin:20px 0 0">De techniek en de brug naar business. Ben vertaalt een bedrijfsprobleem naar een oplossing die werkt, en bouwt ze ook.</p>
          <p style="font-family:'Geist',sans-serif; font-size:12px; color:rgba(var(--fg),.35); margin:20px 0 0">[ persoonlijke bio aan te leveren ]</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="border:1px solid rgba(var(--ov),.1); background:var(--panel)">
        <div style="position:relative; height:360px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(var(--ov),.1); background:radial-gradient(120% 120% at 50% 0%, rgba(0,120,97,.18), rgba(8,11,10,0) 60%), repeating-linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(var(--ov),.035) 0 8px, transparent 8px 16px); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center">
          <span aria-hidden="true" style="font-family:Geist; font-weight:600; font-size:104px; letter-spacing:-.04em; color:rgba(var(--fg),.14)">TK</span>
          <span style="position:absolute; left:20px; bottom:16px; font-family:'Geist',sans-serif; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:.06em; color:rgba(var(--fg),.4)">Foto volgt</span>
        </div>
        <div style="padding:34px 30px">
          <div style="font-family:Geist; font-weight:600; font-size:28px; letter-spacing:-.025em">Tom Kellens</div>
          <div style="font-family:'Geist',sans-serif; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:.14em; color:var(--accent); margin-top:8px">MEDEOPRICHTER</div>
          <p style="font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; color:rgba(var(--fg),.66); margin:20px 0 0">Strategie, aanpak en de klantrelatie. Tom houdt het scherp, eerlijk en pragmatisch, en zorgt dat een traject echt tot resultaat leidt.</p>
          <p style="font-family:'Geist',sans-serif; font-size:12px; color:rgba(var(--fg),.35); margin:20px 0 0">[ persoonlijke bio aan te leveren ]</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="jobs" style="border-top:1px solid rgba(var(--ov),.07)">
    <div class="sec stack-2" style="max-width:1280px; margin:0 auto; padding:90px 32px; display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.85fr) minmax(0,1.15fr); gap:56px; align-items:start">
      <div>
        <div style="font-family:'Geist',sans-serif; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:.16em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--accent); margin-bottom:20px">Open sollicitatie</div>
        <h2 style="font-family:Geist; font-weight:600; font-size:clamp(26px,3vw,38px); letter-spacing:-.03em; margin:0 0 16px">We zoeken versterking.</h2>
        <p style="font-size:17px; line-height:1.6; color:rgba(var(--fg),.66); margin:0; max-width:52ch">Zin om mee te bouwen aan automatisering en AI die echt werkt voor Vlaamse bedrijven? We werken bewust met een klein, sterk team. Geen passende vacature gezien? Stuur ons gerust een open sollicitatie, we lezen alles zelf.</p>
      </div>

      <form id="sollicitatie-form" style="border:1px solid rgba(var(--ov),.1); background:var(--panel); padding:34px 32px; display:grid; gap:22px">
        <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:22px" class="form-row">
          <label style="display:grid; gap:8px">
            <span style="font-family:'Geist',sans-serif; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:.16em; text-transform:uppercase; color:rgba(var(--fg),.5)">Naam *</span>
            <input name="naam" type="text" required autocomplete="name" class="field" placeholder="Je naam" />
          </label>
          <label style="display:grid; gap:8px">
            <span style="font-family:'Geist',sans-serif; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:.16em; text-transform:uppercase; color:rgba(var(--fg),.5)">E-mail *</span>
            <input name="email" type="email" required autocomplete="email" class="field" placeholder="jij@mail.be" />
          </label>
        </div>
        <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:22px" class="form-row">
          <label style="display:grid; gap:8px">
            <span style="font-family:'Geist',sans-serif; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:.16em; text-transform:uppercase; color:rgba(var(--fg),.5)">Telefoon</span>
            <input name="telefoon" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" class="field" placeholder="Optioneel" />
          </label>
          <label style="display:grid; gap:8px">
            <span style="font-family:'Geist',sans-serif; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:.16em; text-transform:uppercase; color:rgba(var(--fg),.5)">Waar ben je sterk in? *</span>
            <input name="rol" type="text" required class="field" placeholder="Bv. backend, RPA, AI-agents" />
          </label>
        </div>
        <label style="display:grid; gap:8px">
          <span style="font-family:'Geist',sans-serif; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:.16em; text-transform:uppercase; color:rgba(var(--fg),.5)">Vertel iets over jezelf *</span>
          <textarea name="motivatie" required rows="5" class="field" placeholder="Wat je doet, wat je zoekt, waarom BTTMLINE."></textarea>
        </label>
        <label style="display:grid; gap:8px">
          <span style="font-family:'Geist',sans-serif; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:.16em; text-transform:uppercase; color:rgba(var(--fg),.5)">Link naar cv of LinkedIn</span>
          <input name="link" type="url" class="field" placeholder="https:// (optioneel)" />
        </label>
        <div style="display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; gap:18px">
          <button type="submit" class="btn-cta" style="background:#007861; color:#FFFFFF; font-family:'Geist',sans-serif; letter-spacing:.04em; padding:15px 26px; border:1px solid #00A583; cursor:pointer">Verstuur sollicitatie</button>
          <span id="sollicitatie-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" style="font-family:'Geist',sans-serif; font-size:12px; color:rgba(var(--fg),.5)"></span>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .field {
      width: 100%;
      background: var(--bg);
      border: 1px solid rgba(var(--ov), .14);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: Geist, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 16px;
      padding: 13px 14px;
      outline: none;
      transition: border-color .2s ease, box-shadow .2s ease;
    }
    .field::placeholder { color: rgba(var(--fg), .32); }
    .field:focus {
      border-color: rgba(43, 216, 168, .6);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(0, 120, 97, .18);
    }
    textarea.field { resize: vertical; min-height: 120px; line-height: 1.5; }
    @media (max-width: 560px) {
      #sollicitatie-form .form-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; }
    }
  </style>

  <script>
    const jobForm = document.getElementById('sollicitatie-form');
    const jobStatus = document.getElementById('sollicitatie-status');
    if (jobForm && jobStatus) {
      jobForm.addEventListener('submit', (e) => {
        e.preventDefault();
        const d = new FormData(jobForm);
        const naam = (d.get('naam') || '').toString().trim();
        const email = (d.get('email') || '').toString().trim();
        const telefoon = (d.get('telefoon') || '').toString().trim();
        const rol = (d.get('rol') || '').toString().trim();
        const motivatie = (d.get('motivatie') || '').toString().trim();
        const link = (d.get('link') || '').toString().trim();

        const subject = `Open sollicitatie: ${naam}`;
        const body =
          `Naam: ${naam}\n` +
          `E-mail: ${email}\n` +
          `Telefoon: ${telefoon || '-'}\n` +
          `Sterk in: ${rol}\n` +
          `Link: ${link || '-'}\n\n` +
          `Over: \n${motivatie}\n`;

        window.location.href =
          `mailto:info@bttmline.be?subject=${encodeURIComponent(subject)}&body=${encodeURIComponent(body)}`;

        jobStatus.textContent = 'Je mailprogramma opent met je sollicitatie, druk op verzenden.';
        jobStatus.style.color = 'var(--accent)';
      });
    }
  </script>

</Base>
